            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Sườn Cô Cám",
            "review_text": "Vant511\nLao Cai, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGood staff, tasty food, nice decoration\nMay 2019 • Couples\nWe had lunch with Vietnamese Style fish and BBQ pork ribs. The food was good with reasonable price (from 55.000 VND to 65.000 VND as I remember). There was also vegetarian food. Staff could not speak English but the owner spoke very well. I love the cozy decoration there. It is about 3km from Lao Cai train station.\nWritten May 26, 2019",
